{"page":18,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:113","surah":2,"ayah":113,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَتِ ٱلْيَهُودُ لَيْسَتِ ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ عَلَىٰ شَىْءٍ وَقَالَتِ ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ لَيْسَتِ ٱلْيَهُودُ عَلَىٰ شَىْءٍ وَهُمْ يَتْلُونَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ مِثْلَ قَوْلِهِمْ ۚ فَٱللَّهُ يَحْكُمُ بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Jews say, ‘The Christians have no ground whatsoever to stand on,’ and the Christians say, ‘The Jews have no ground whatsoever to stand on,’ though they both read the Scripture, and those who have no knowledge say the same; God will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning their differences.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَتِ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqālati","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودُ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūdu","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَيْسَتِ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"laysati","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"the Christians","transliteration":"l-naṣārā","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(are) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":6,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَقَالَتِ","en_gloss":"and said","transliteration":"waqālati","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"the Christians","transliteration":"l-naṣārā","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَيْسَتِ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"laysati","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودُ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūdu","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(are) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"although they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"2:113"},{"pos":14,"a